    { math: '2 · The Stern Review framing', note: 'Stern (2006): climate damage costs ~5–20% of GDP per century vs mitigation ~1% — an investment case, contested on the discount rate (Nordhaus vs Stern: how much do future people count? — an ethics question inside an economics parameter).' },
